      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming detached country home at the foot of the Sugarloaf Mountain\r\n\r\nApproximately 220 sq. m (2,377 sq. ft) of versatile accommodation\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 0.5 acres of private, mature gardens\r\n\r\nSecluded driveway framed by established trees and flowering plants\r\n\r\nOriginal 1930s cottage with later extensions\r\n\r\nSix bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite\r\n\r\nTwo additional reception rooms suitable for home offices or guest accommodation\r\n\r\nSpacious living/dining room, country-style kitchen and conservatory\r\n\r\nSelf-contained one-bedroom flat within the original cottage, with its own rear garden\r\n\r\nConvenient to Kilmacanogue, Bray, Enniskerry and Greystones, with easy access to the N11 and M50"
